title: Viaduct
text: Three piers hold up two arches, and each lamp post needs its own colour. Which laser belongs on which pier?
trick: fixed gates at the tops of the arches are fed by starburst rays; the red and blue lamps decide that magenta goes to the middle pier, so the lasers cross over to reach their piers
motif: a viaduct: three starburst piers on an occupied deck between two abutments, two arches with lamp posts above, the arch feet walled below the deck
ink: 4
expect: depth>=3, shared>=6
